{"id":69016,"date":"2022-09-28T19:22:46","date_gmt":"2022-09-28T18:22:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69016"},"modified":"2026-09-30T15:55:29","modified_gmt":"2026-09-30T14:55:29","slug":"corrida-de-macieira-lousada","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-de-macieira-lousada\/","title":{"rendered":"IV Corrida de Macieira &#8211; Lousada 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">IV Corrida de Macieira &#8211; Lousada 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>IV Corrida de Macieira &#8211; Lousada 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>29 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida agendada para as <strong>10:00<\/strong> no Largo de S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo em <strong>Macieira<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Lousada<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Esta prova de atletismo de estrada re\u00fane corredores e entusiastas num circuito r\u00e1pido e acolhedor.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O evento conta com a dist\u00e2ncia oficial de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (10.000 metros), devidamente aferida em piso de asfalto com partida e chegada no Largo de S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura postos de abastecimento, controlo de tempos com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, apoio m\u00e9dico ao longo do percurso e lembran\u00e7a comemorativa a todos os atletas que conclu\u00edrem a prova.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>AMA \u2013 Macieira Atletismo<\/strong>, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lousada, da Junta de Freguesia de Macieira e da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto, garantindo qualidade t\u00e9cnica e seguran\u00e7a aos participantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-brea